<title>USA: Ambac qualifies seven muni issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>Ambac qualifies seven muni issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ambac Assurance Corp said Tuesday it qualified for bond insurance the following seven municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--Laguna Salada Unified School District, Calif., $3.3 million general obligation bonds.  </p>
<p>--Oxnard School District, Calif., $5 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Brookhaven, N.Y., $31.98 million public improvement bonds.</p>
<p>--East Aurora, N.Y., $2.79 million various purpose bonds.</p>
<p>--Liverpool Central School District, N.Y., $5.056 million school bonds.</p>
<p>--Anderson County School District No 1, S.C., $1.6 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Jackson, Tenn., $35.73 million GOs.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
